 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "My mother was always on a diet.",
   "from": 4,
   "to": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "Everything in our fridge was",
   "from": 43,
   "to": 69
  },
  {
   "text": "diet yogurt,",
   "from": 69,
   "to": 98
  },
  {
   "text": "diet milk,",
   "from": 110,
   "to": 134
  },
  {
   "text": "diet shakes,",
   "from": 134,
   "to": 158
  },
  {
   "text": "so you pretty much",
   "from": 158,
   "to": 181
  },
  {
   "text": "learn what you live.",
   "from": 181,
   "to": 204
  },
  {
   "text": "And so I began many, many years",
   "from": 204,
   "to": 259
  },
  {
   "text": "of dieting.",
   "from": 259,
   "to": 285
  },
  {
   "text": "After years of dieting,",
   "from": 285,
   "to": 309
  },
  {
   "text": "my weight stayed exactly the same.",
   "from": 309,
   "to": 369
  },
  {
   "text": "I can wear whatever I want.",
   "from": 369,
   "to": 395
  },
  {
   "text": "I just wasted 15 years",
   "from": 395,
   "to": 442
  },
  {
   "text": "because I didn't understand",
   "from": 442,
   "to": 474
  },
  {
   "text": "that your psychology is having",
   "from": 474,
   "to": 519
  },
  {
   "text": "a full-on conversation",
   "from": 519,
   "to": 548
  },
  {
   "text": "with your biology.",
   "from": 548,
   "to": 568
  },
  {
   "text": "“I can't eat that or I'll get fat”",
   "from": 568,
   "to": 623
  },
  {
   "text": "becomes your reality.",
   "from": 623,
   "to": 653
  },
  {
   "text": "Actually, if you say,",
   "from": 653,
   "to": 679
  },
  {
   "text": "“I get fat just looking at a cake,”",
   "from": 679,
   "to": 746
  },
  {
   "text": "do you know that thought",
   "from": 746,
   "to": 767
  },
  {
   "text": "creates cortisol,",
   "from": 767,
   "to": 804
  },
  {
   "text": "and cortisol makes you gain weight.",
   "from": 812,
   "to": 864
  },
  {
   "text": "So it's true that you can say,",
   "from": 864,
   "to": 895
  },
  {
   "text": "“I can gain weight",
   "from": 895,
   "to": 915
  },
  {
   "text": "just thinking about cake.”",
   "from": 915,
   "to": 944
  },
  {
   "text": "Also true that you can be",
   "from": 944,
   "to": 1006
  },
  {
   "text": "a perfect weight while eating cake.",
   "from": 1006,
   "to": 1059
  }
 ]
